OL,3,AKit Harington replaces Nicholas Hoult
OL,4,Ain HBO's Harry Potter series
OL,5,
OL,6,FKit Harington is joining the highly
OL,7,Fanticipated Harry Potter TV series as
OL,8,Fthe wizarding world's
OL,9,Fcelebrity-turned-Hogwarts instructor
OL,10,FGilderoy Lockhart.
OL,12,FX-Men star Nicholas Hoult was
OL,13,Foriginally cast in the second series
OL,14,Fearlier this month but has now left due
OL,15,Fto scheduling issues, according to HBO.
OL,17,FBest known for playing Jon Snow in Game
OL,18,Fof Thrones, Harington also appears in
OL,19,FBBC and HBO financial drama Industry.
OL,20,FThe star previously voiced Lockhart in
OL,21,Fan audio version of Harry Potter.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
